Although this quest gives an experience message, there is no visible experience given at level 4.

== Walkthrough ==

You say, 'Hail, Captain Gideen'

: [[Captain Gideen]] says 'I hope you have come to assist in the defense of the gate. We have had numerous assaults by the goblins. No doubt it is due to those [goblin watchers].'

You say, 'What goblin watchers?'

: Captain Gideen says 'The goblin watchers are rumored to be the communication link between goblin outposts and patrols. We have found goblin [[Watcher Signal Torch]]es on a few of them. You bring me back no fewer than three and I will reward you.' 

Hand in three [[Watcher Signal Torch]]:

: Captain Gideen says 'Good work, player name. You are on your way to becoming a respected ally of the Iksar Empire. Keep up the good work. Take this reward for a job well done.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Legion of Cabilis]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Cabilis Residents]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Scaled Mystics]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Crusaders Of Greenmist]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Swift Tails]] got better.
</div>
{{exp}}

You receive 7 silver from Captain Gideen.

